index 0000000..e9b6989
--- /dev/null
+++ b/config/MASTER.arm64.guacamole
@@ -0,0 +1,115 @@
+#
+# guacamole (OnePlus 7 Pro, SM8150): the sweet port on a second board.
+# Same options as MASTER.arm64.sweet; the open-source arm64 assembly and
+# pmap come from the same place (nos_arm_asm, nos_arm_pmap). Per-device
+# addresses live in pexpert/pexpert/arm64/sweet_dev.h (kernel) and
+# tools/devices.py (ADT/shim); shim/boards/guacamole.h mirrors them.
